  <div class="step-flow">
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num-circle">1</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Planning &amp; Scoping</strong>
        <p>Define the scope, get written authorization, identify stakeholders, and set the rules of engagement. Never scan systems without permission — it's illegal under laws like the Computer Fraud and Abuse Act (CFAA).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num-circle">2</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Asset Discovery</strong>
        <p>Identify all live hosts, devices, services, and open ports on the target network. Nmap shines here — it can discover thousands of hosts in minutes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num-circle">3</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Vulnerability Scanning</strong>
        <p>Run automated scanners (Nessus, OpenVAS) to probe discovered assets for known vulnerabilities, misconfigurations, outdated software, and weak credentials.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num-circle">4</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Analysis &amp; Prioritization</strong>
        <p>Review scan results, eliminate false positives, and prioritize findings by CVSS severity score, exploitability, and business impact.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num-circle">5</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Remediation &amp; Patching</strong>
        <p>Work with system owners to patch, mitigate, or accept risks. Apply patches, change configurations, disable unnecessary services, or implement compensating controls.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num-circle">6</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Reporting &amp; Verification</strong>
        <p>Document findings in a structured report for technical and executive audiences. Re-scan after remediation to verify fixes were effective. VA should be a continuous cycle.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


