<span class="comment"># Examples of target specification:</span>
<span class="cmd">nmap</span> <span class="string">192.168.1.1</span>          <span class="comment"># Single IP</span>
<span class="cmd">nmap</span> <span class="string">192.168.1.1-254</span>      <span class="comment"># IP range</span>
<span class="cmd">nmap</span> <span class="string">192.168.1.0/24</span>       <span class="comment"># CIDR subnet</span>
<span class="cmd">nmap</span> <span class="string">example.com</span>          <span class="comment"># Hostname</span>
<span class="cmd">nmap</span> <span class="flag">-iL</span> <span class="string">targets.txt</span>     <span class="comment"># From file</span></pre>
  </div>

  <h3>Nmap Port States</h3>
  <div class="card-grid-3">
